  "title": "Special Raisin Cream Pie",
  "description": "A lovely, sour cream and raisin filling is sandwiched between two layers of sweetened cream cheese that 's topped with whipped topping. The pie is then slipped into the fridge to chill and firm up. For some variation, try adding some dried cranberries along with the raisins.",
